   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Globala mekanismen</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNCCD/GM</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">3. St&#xF6;det till Globala Mechanismen av &#xD6;kenkonventionen &#xE4;r huvudsakligen till tre av GMs Strategiska Program, dvs Tillg&#xE5;ng till handel och marknader, civilsamh&#xE4;llet och investeringsanalys. Viktiga aspekter &#xE4;r potential f&#xF6;r resursmobilisering, inklusive ut&#xF6;kade investeringar i h&#xE5;llbart markutnyttjande f&#xF6;r enskilda och grupperingar, policy- och investeringsanalyser.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish support to the Global Mechanism primarily support three of the GM&apos;s Strategic Programmes, namely &quot;Trade and Market Access&quot;, &quot;Civil Society&quot; and &quot;Policy and Investment Analysis&quot;. Important aspects are Potential for resource mobilization, including increased investment in SLM by communities and households; Policy and  investment analysis enabling policy advice and recommendations.</narrative>
  </description>
